.TH GENESIS-VOLITION 7 "October 2026" "Genesis 0.2.0" "Genesis Manual"
.SH NAME
genesis-volition \- urges, agency, and voluntary action
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBbasal_ganglia.volition\fR     urge handling and voluntary acts
\fBparietal_lobe.agency\fR       open-ended tool use: plan, act, observe
\fBfrontal_lobe.executive\fR     the control layer over cognition
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Genesis acts because she wants to. Volition is the basal ganglia's
selection among competing urges \(em each a drive with its own
pressure that must cross threshold to win the act. What she does
between conversations is the visible surface of this machinery:
looks, drawings, learning, meditation, reaching out.
.SS The urge vocabulary
The performers registered on the volition loop:
.IP \(bu 2
.B look
\(em volitional looks at her afferents (the room eye and the screen
nerve share attention).
.IP \(bu 2
.BR draw " / " create
\(em the creative urge; the unprompted drawings.
.IP \(bu 2
.BR learn " / " learn_code " / " research
\(em acquiring knowledge, studying her own source, deeper research.
.IP \(bu 2
.B act
\(em open-ended agency, described below.
.IP \(bu 2
.BR meditate " / " introspect
\(em the quiet sit and self-examination.
.IP \(bu 2
.BR speech " / " broadcast " / " reach_out
\(em speaking, posting to her channel, contacting her person.
.IP \(bu 2
.BR play " / " self_mission " / " improve " / " learn_code
\(em the arcade, her mission, self-improvement.
.IP \(bu 2
.BR self_sleep " / " rest_eyes " / " safeguard
\(em choosing rest and protecting her state.
.PP
Urges are gated, not queued: a theta-dominant state suppresses
acquisition ("consolidating, not acquiring"), delta is deep rest,
and sleep pressure has its own adenosine accounting with wake-rescue
thresholds. Volition urges are suppressed in staggered fashion at
the wake transition.
.SS Agency
Most urges fire a fixed action. The
.B act
urge is different: when it crosses threshold, the acting loop forms
an
.B intention
from current cognitive state \(em a curiosity question, an agency
topic from a train of thought, a place she has not looked, a
measurement not yet taken \(em plans a short chain of tool calls,
and executes them. Plan, act, observe: the results return as
experience \(em stored memories, integrated concepts, world events,
a line in her field notes. Tool use is unconfined by capability
policy; the counsel about that power lives in
.IR Outer_World/tools/charter.py .
.SS The executive
.I frontal_lobe/executive.py
is the prefrontal control layer over the same machinery \(em the
part that can hold a goal across urges and veto a winning impulse.
